        "en": "Yes, very! What's for breakfast?"
      },
      {
        "speaker": "Мама",
        "ru": "Каша, хлеб и сыр.",
        "stress": "Ка́ша, хлеб и сыр.",
        "translit": "Kásha, khleb i syr.",
        "en": "Porridge, bread and cheese."
      },
